# Live Vercel (zeroed-two.vercel.app, 2026-10-26):
#   /  → HSTS + cache-control max-age=0 + ACAO *
#   hashed /assets/*.js → ACAO * + HSTS; Vite hashed assets are served
#   immutable 1y on a typical Vercel Vite deploy, so we restore that here.
# nosniff stays. No XFO / XSS / Permissions / Referrer (live does not send them).

/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=63072000; includeSubDomains; preload
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *

/
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate

/index.html
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate

/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
